{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.UnitaryGroup"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.su2_emergence_gauge_group_unitary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_gauge_group_unitary","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity.lean#L62-L73","doc":"**`G ⊆ U(2)`** ([`lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity`]).\n\nIf every element `g` of the gauge group `G` (realised as a set of\n`2×2` complex matrices on the fibre `τ(V)`) preserves the Frobenius\ndagger, then `G ⊆ U(2)`.  Derived pointwise from\n`su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/su2_emergence_dagger_unitarity.lean#L37-L60","doc":"**`g ∈ U(2)` from Frobenius-dagger preservation — archimedean realisation**\n([`lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity`]).\n\nA `2×2` complex matrix `g` that preserves the standard Hermitian\npairing on the fibre `τ(V) = ℂ²` (i.e. `g · gᴴ = 1`, the concrete\nform of \"`g` preserves the Frobenius dagger\") is unitary,\n`g ∈ U(2)`.\n\nGenuine derivation: the hypothesis `g * star g = 1` is the full\ncontent of `Matrix.mem_unitaryGroup_iff`, and the conclusion is\nmembership in `Matrix.unitaryGroup (Fin 2) ℂ`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity","label":"lem:su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/su2-emergence-dagger-unitarity.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}